---
// „So läuft eine Fahrt“: drei Etappen mit eigenen Illustrationen.
---
<ol class="steps">
  <li class="step rv" style="--i:0">
    <svg class="il" viewBox="0 0 320 180" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" role="img" aria-label="Gefaltete Karte mit eingezeichneter Route"><title>Gefaltete Karte mit eingezeichneter Route</title>
      <defs><linearGradient id="s1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--il-sky1)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--il-sky2)"/></linearGradient></defs>
      <rect width="320" height="180" fill="url(#s1)"/>
      <path d="M0 150c60-18 120-14 180-4s100 4 140-8v42H0z" fill="var(--il-h3)"/>
      <g transform="translate(70 30)">
        <path d="M0 14 60 0v104L0 118z" fill="var(--il-h1)"/><path d="M60 0l60 14v104L60 104z" fill="var(--il-h2)"/><path d="M120 14 180 0v104l-60 14z" fill="var(--il-h1)"/>
        <path d="M10 44c16-10 30-6 42 2M12 66c14-8 26-6 40 0M70 30c14 8 28 8 42 0M70 56c14 10 30 8 42 2M130 40c12-8 26-8 40-2M130 64c14-8 26-6 40 0" fill="none" stroke="var(--il-tree)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M18 92c14-22 28-8 42-26s26 6 46-10 30-2 52-24" fill="none" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle cx="18" cy="92" r="6" fill="var(--il-snow)"/><circle cx="18" cy="92" r="2.6" fill="var(--il-ink)"/>
        <path d="M158 32V14" stroke="var(--il-snow)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M158 14h14l-4 4.5 4 4.5h-14z" fill="#2DD4BF"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="step-b"><span class="step-n"><i>1</i>Etappe</span><h3>Route holen</h3><p>Importiere deine Strecke aus Komoot &amp; Co. oder wähl ein Training aus der Bibliothek.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li class="step rv" style="--i:1">
    <svg class="il" viewBox="0 0 320 180" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" role="img" aria-label="Rad auf dem Smart-Trainer, daneben Zeichen für Puls und Funk"><title>Rad auf dem Smart-Trainer, daneben Zeichen für Puls und Funk</title>
      <defs><linearGradient id="s2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--il-sky1)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--il-sky2)"/></linearGradient></defs>
      <rect width="320" height="180" fill="url(#s2)"/>
      <rect y="146" width="320" height="34" fill="var(--il-h3)"/>
      <ellipse cx="160" cy="147" rx="92" ry="5" fill="var(--il-ink)" opacity=".35"/>
      <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="212" cy="116" r="30" stroke="var(--il-snow)" stroke-width="5"/>
        <path d="M118 116l22-48h48l24 48M140 68l34 48h-56M188 68l-14 48" stroke="var(--il-tree)" stroke-width="6"/>
        <path d="M132 60h18M186 54l6 14M180 54h16" stroke="var(--il-snow)" stroke-width="5"/>
        <circle cx="174" cy="116" r="9" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="5"/>
      </g>
      <path d="M92 146l14-40h24l14 40z" fill="var(--il-rock)"/><circle cx="118" cy="116" r="15" fill="var(--il-h1)" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="4"/>
      <g fill="none" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M70 104a16 16 0 0 1 0 24" opacity=".9"/><path d="M60 96a28 28 0 0 1 0 40" opacity=".55"/><path d="M50 88a40 40 0 0 1 0 56" opacity=".28"/></g>
      <g transform="translate(262 40)"><circle r="17" fill="var(--il-h1)"/><path d="M0 8s-9-5.4-9-11.6A5 5 0 0 1 0-6.5 5 5 0 0 1 9-3.6C9 2.600 0 8 0 8z" fill="#FF6B7A"/></g>
    </svg>
    <div class="step-b"><span class="step-n"><i>2</i>Etappe</span><h3>Aufsteigen</h3><p>Verbinde Trainer, Pulsgurt und Schaltung. Passo merkt sich deine Geräte.</p></div>
  </li>
  <li class="step rv" style="--i:2">
    <svg class="il" viewBox="0 0 320 180" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" role="img" aria-label="Höhenprofil mit Fahrer am Anstieg und Steigungsanzeige"><title>Höhenprofil mit Fahrer am Anstieg und Steigungsanzeige</title>
      <defs><linearGradient id="s3" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--il-sky1)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--il-sky2)"/></linearGradient></defs>
      <rect width="320" height="180" fill="url(#s3)"/>
      <g fill="var(--il-snow)" opacity="var(--il-star)"><circle cx="40" cy="28" r="1.4"/><circle cx="118" cy="46" r="1.1"/><circle cx="286" cy="24" r="1.3"/></g>
      <path d="M0 120c50-14 90-6 130-22s80-34 110-40 50-2 80-18v140H0z" fill="var(--il-h1)"/>
      <path d="M0 150c40-4 70-2 104-14s60-40 96-52 70-10 120-40v136H0z" fill="var(--il-h2)"/>
      <path d="M0 150c40-4 70-2 104-14s60-40 96-52" fill="none" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M200 84c36-12 70-10 120-40" fill="none" stroke="var(--il-tree)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <g transform="translate(200 84)"><circle r="13" fill="#2DD4BF" opacity=".22"/><circle r="6.5" fill="#2DD4BF" stroke="var(--il-h2)" stroke-width="2.5"/></g>
      <g transform="translate(172 34)"><rect width="62" height="26" rx="8" fill="#2DD4BF"/><path d="M26 26l6 8 6-8z" fill="#2DD4BF"/><text x="31" y="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#042F2E">7,4 %</text></g>
      <path d="M296 44V28" stroke="var(--il-snow)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M296 28h12l-3.500 4 3.500 4h-12z" fill="var(--il-snow)"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="step-b"><span class="step-n"><i>3</i>Etappe</span><h3>Fahren</h3><p>Der Trainer stellt die Steigung der Strecke. Du schaltest, trittst und kommst oben an.</p></div>
  </li>
</ol>
